def add_edge(graph, node1, node2):
    # Add node1 to graph if it doesn't exist
    if node1 not in graph:
        graph[node1] = []

    # Add node2 to graph if it doesn't exist
    if node2 not in graph:
        graph[node2] = []

    # Add edge from node1 to node2 (if not already present)
    if node2 not in graph[node1]:
        graph[node1].append(node2)

    # Since the problem does not specify direction, add edge from node2 to node1 as well
    if node1 not in graph[node2]:
        graph[node2].append(node1)
```

